[
{
"id": 22866,
"en": "\"What are those?\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22867,
"en": "Not even an explanation.\nSounds like he's really in a hurry.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22868,
"en": "Prepaid cards, huh? Not a term I know,\nbut I should be able to figure it out.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22869,
"en": "\"I'm on it.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22870,
"en": "That's a lot of cash...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22871,
"en": "Wow, Date-san's pretty aggressive over email.\nI guess he can be himself when he types?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22872,
"en": "The Mama from New Serena's got him on\na tight leash, after all. Must be tough.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22873,
"en": "\"All right. I'll be in touch later.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22874,
"en": "So, 50 grand's worth of prepaid cards...\nI should head over to a convenience store.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22875,
"en": "Sorry, but do you guys have any prepaid cards?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22876,
"en": "Uh, I'm sorry, sir.\nWe're completely out of stock.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22877,
"en": "I see.\nThanks anyway.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22878,
"en": "Sorry again, sir.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22879,
"en": "No, it's okay.\nI'll try checking somewhere else.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22880,
"en": "Here, too?\nAre they really <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> popular?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22881,
"en": "Right, Date-san asked me to buy\na few prepaid cards for him.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22882,
"en": "Sorry, but do you guys have any prepaid cards?\nI'm looking for five 10,000 yen ones.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22883,
"en": "We most certainly do.\nYour total will be 50,000 yen.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22884,
"en": "Shoot. I don't have enough cash.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22885,
"en": "Sorry, I'll be back later.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22886,
"en": "Okay. Here you go.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22887,
"en": "Great, I managed to get the prepaid cards\nDate-san was asking for. I should let him know.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22888,
"en": "\"I got the cards.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22889,
"en": "Hm... Something feels off here...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22890,
"en": "Oh well. Date-san's in trouble,\nso I should help him out as soon as I can.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22891,
"en": "All done.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22892,
"en": "\"Here are the photos.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22893,
"en": "Weird. He totally stopped responding.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22894,
"en": "Hm? What's he talking about?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22895,
"en": "\"I sent the photos you wanted.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22896,
"en": "\"I don't understand.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22897,
"en": "\"You don't have it, Date-san?\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22898,
"en": "I don't think I understand.\nDid someone scam me...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22899,
"en": "\"What should I do?\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22900,
"en": "\"Sounds good.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22901,
"en": "They took 50,000 yen right out from under my nose.\nI really should be more careful with this stuff...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22902,
"en": "I wonder what he needs them for.\nMaybe I should ask.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22903,
"en": "\"What do you need them for?\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22904,
"en": "Hm? This really doesn't feel normal.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22905,
"en": "I need to get to the bottom of this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22906,
"en": "\"Where are you?\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22907,
"en": "\"I'd rather give you the cards in person.\nI'm not so good at taking pictures.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22908,
"en": "This just keeps getting worse.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22909,
"en": "\"It'd be quicker to give them to you in person.\nI'm in Kamurocho, too.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22910,
"en": "No response, huh?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22911,
"en": "There we go.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22912,
"en": "\"Where should we meet?\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22913,
"en": "\"See you soon.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22914,
"en": "All right. I'll find out soon enough\nif this really is Date-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22915,
"en": "This is where I'm supposed\nto meet \"Date-san\"...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22916,
"en": "You're Kiryu-san, yes?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22917,
"en": "You don't look like Date-san to me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22918,
"en": "Wrong. I definitely Date-san.\nYou give prepaid card now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22919,
"en": "Some scammers you are.\nYou should never have agreed to meet me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22920,
"en": "You not going to give them to me?\nThen I take them from you!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22921,
"en": "Too slow, Date-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22922,
"en": "\"Don't worry. I handled it.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22923,
"en": "\"The usual way.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22924,
"en": "\"I'm on the roof of the ** Building\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22925,
"en": "\"You sure do.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22926,
"en": "I really oughta be more careful.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a12|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22927,
"en": "Hey, you there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22928,
"en": "Heh, you interested in a game of darts?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22929,
"en": "I'm really itchin' to play. It's all I can think about.\nThat's why I'm hangin' around in this bar.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22930,
"en": "Nobody's been interested in playin' me, though.\nBut you seem like you're up for a challenge!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22931,
"en": "This guy is a real piece of work...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22932,
"en": "So, how 'bout it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22933,
"en": "All right, then.\nI guess I have time for a round.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22934,
"en": "Oh! You're more chill than ya let on, man!\nThe name's Akaishizawa. Nice to meet ya.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22935,
"en": "Sweet! C'mon, Kiryu-chi!\nLet's get tossin'!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22936,
"en": "Sorry, but I'm too busy.\nMaybe some other time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22937,
"en": "Huhhh? C'mon, man!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22938,
"en": "Whatever. I'll be chillin' here for a bit.\nJust talk to me if you wanna throw down!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22939,
"en": "Oh! You want some of this?\nI'm ready to play if you are!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22940,
"en": "You're damn good, Kiryu-chi!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22941,
"en": "Yay! I'm the best!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22942,
"en": "Paul-san! Can I get your autograph!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22943,
"en": "Please let me shake your hand, Paul-san!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22944,
"en": "What're they so excited about?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22945,
"en": "No way...!\nThat's Paul Lim!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22946,
"en": "Whoa, it's really him!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22947,
"en": "Hey, who <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> this guy?\nPaul something or other?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22948,
"en": "Huh!? Ya can't be a real dart slinger\nif you don't know who Paul Lim is!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22949,
"en": "Well, I've never heard of him.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22950,
"en": "Listen up. I'll tell ya 'bout Paul Lim.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22951,
"en": "He was the first person <font_kind=yakuza_italic>ever</font_kind> to throw\na perfect game in a major international tourney.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22952,
"en": "For anyone into the darts scene, he's like a god.\nThis guy's a livin' legend, man!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22953,
"en": "Huh. So the old man has some talent, then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22954,
"en": "Hey, don't talk about him like that!\nWhat if he hears ya mouthin' off!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22955,
"en": "Shit shit shit! He's comin' this way!\nThis is all your fault, man!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22956,
"en": "[I've been watching you guys play.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22957,
"en": "Is that English...? What's he saying?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22958,
"en": "Ya serious!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22959,
"en": "Hm? You speak English?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22960,
"en": "Yeah, I actually lived outta the country for a bit.\nAin't nobody as good at English as me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22961,
"en": "Interesting.\nWell then, what did he say?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22962,
"en": "Apparently he was keepin'\nan eye on our game!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22963,
"en": "[You've got ways to go, but I can tell you,\nyou've got a talent for this.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22964,
"en": "Huh!? For real!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22965,
"en": "Hey, what did he say?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22966,
"en": "He was sayin' I'm still inexperienced,\nbut I'm gonna be a star someday!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22967,
"en": "Mannn, I can't believe <font_kind=yakuza_italic>the</font_kind> Paul Lim's complimentin' me!\nPinch me, I'm dreamin'! Thanks, man!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22968,
"en": "[Ah... Not you.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22969,
"en": "[You.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22970,
"en": "What? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Me</font_kind>?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22971,
"en": "[Yes.\nWhat's your name?]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22972,
"en": "[Name?]\nIt's, uh... Kiryu.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22973,
"en": "[You have the potential\nto be a great player, Kiryu-san.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22974,
"en": "[I hope you'll continue to enjoy darts\nand keep polishing your skills.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22975,
"en": "He says ya got some serious potential, man.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22976,
"en": "Oh, and ya should keep playin' darts\nif you wanna get crazy good.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22977,
"en": "[I look forward to the day when\nwe can have a heated match.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22978,
"en": "He said he's hopin' you two can square off someday.\nOh, and \"hahahahaha\"!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22979,
"en": "Hot damn! So freakin' cool, man!\nPaul Lim wants to play against <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> of all people!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22980,
"en": "I'm damn jealous of ya!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22981,
"en": "Getting complimented by some random old man\ndoesn't feel that exciting to me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22982,
"en": "But y'know, I had the same thought when we were playin'.\nYou're a goddamn genius, Kiryu-chi.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22983,
"en": "Really? I'm not sure about that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22984,
"en": "C'mon! If both me <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> Paul think so,\nit's gotta be true!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22985,
"en": "Oh, I almost forgot.\nAs a thanks for playin' me, ya can have these.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22986,
"en": "If ya keep practicin', practicin', practicin',\nyou're gonna be a pro in no time flat.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22987,
"en": "Not sure you're ever gonna beat\nthe legendary Paul Lim, though!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22988,
"en": "The living legend, Paul Lim...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22989,
"en": "I should play some more if I get the chance.\nMaybe someday I can be a darts legend, too...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22990,
"en": "[Hello, Mr. Kiryu.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22991,
"en": "Hm? You're that guy from before.\nPaul Lim, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 22992,
"en": "[So we meet again.]",
