"en": "[Yes!\nCome on!]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23014,
"en": "Whoaaa! This match is gonna be off the hook!\nSo freakin' pumped!",
