"en": "[If you're feeling up to the challenge,\ncome see me.]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23020,
"en": "He says he's gonna hang 'round here.\nIf you ever wanna tussle, just let him know.",
