"max": null
},
{
"id": 23037,
"en": "He's lookin' forward to playin' ya again!\nOh, and \"hahahahaha\"!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23038,
"en": "I should give him another match sometime.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23039,
"en": "[Hello, Kiryu-san.\nWould you like to challenge me to a match?]",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a14|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23040,
"en": "Oh, Kiryu-chi!\nYou wanna play against Paul Lim?",
