"max": null
},
{
"id": 23053,
"en": "But... We're so poor,\nI can't take money from her...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23054,
"en": "Little bitch... You want more bruises then?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23055,
"en": "If you don't got the money, who's got the tab for\ntoday, huh? How you gonna make up for the loss?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23056,
"en": "A crew of bullies, huh?\nScum of the earth...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23057,
"en": "Poor guy... Last time we talked, he mentioned\nhe was getting picked on by a bad crowd...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23058,
"en": "At the time, I told him not to run away and face\nthem head on... But that was irresponsible, huh?",
