"max": null
},
{
"id": 23059,
"en": "We have to help him!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23060,
"en": "No, wait.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23061,
"en": "Sorry... But this behavior...\nCan't you guys shape up?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23062,
"en": "Please... Stop doing it...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23063,
"en": "Dumbass... Am I hearing this right?\nYou suddenly grow a pair?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23064,
"en": "I... won't run from this anymore...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23065,
"en": "That so?\nThen let's see where that gets you!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23066,
"en": "Hey, you want some too, old man!?\nThis ain't your concern, is it!?",
