"id": 23073,
"en": "Th-Thank you so much!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23074,
"en": "No, I was only here because\nyou've been there for her.",
