"max": null
},
{
"id": 23079,
"en": "I mean, it almost got me killed, but...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23080,
"en": "I'm sorry. I didn't know how bad things were for\nyou, and I told you to face them like a fool...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23081,
"en": "No, even if that's not what you'd told me,\nI probably would have stood up to them.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23082,
"en": "I saw your last match, Saki-san. You were up against\na huge foreigner, but you kept standing back up, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23083,
"en": "You ended up losing that match...\nBut I was so inspired by you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23084,
"en": "Saki-san, you were so cool... I realized\nI had to stand up to them like you would.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23085,
"en": "So, even if you'd told me not to,\nI still had your example to follow.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23086,
"en": "Saki-san... Thank you for giving me that courage.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23087,
"en": "Right... Likewise.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23088,
"en": "I'll be at your next match for sure!\nShow me the strength I know you've got, Saki-san!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23089,
"en": "Well, see ya!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23090,
"en": "Sounds like you're already a great wrestler, Saki.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23091,
"en": "Whether you won or lost... What's important is\nwhat you showed that kid through wrestling.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23092,
"en": "Kiryu-san... I've never been so happy\nto be a professional wrestler.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23093,
"en": "I'm sorry I ended up dragging you\ninto a fist fight, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23094,
"en": "Don't sweat it.\nI'm used to it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23095,
"en": "Besides, you're a professional wrestler. Doesn't\nmatter who, you can't fight a civilian, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23096,
"en": "So, what do you say we go back to our date, where\nyou can be the cheerful Saki you always are?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23097,
"en": "Yeah...! Good call!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23098,
"en": "But... Before we go...\nCan we have just a minute together?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23099,
"en": "Hm? Sure, I don't mind.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a15|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a17|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23100,
"en": "Hm? Isn't that... Hikaru?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23101,
"en": "Well, shall we be on our way? I must say,\nyou're just as cute as the talent judge said.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23102,
"en": "Thank you. Will the talent judge be\ncoming along today, too?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23103,
"en": "I hadn't heard. I don't think he's in today?\nBut, nothing you have to worry about.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23104,
"en": "C'mon, let's roll babe.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23105,
"en": "Okay. <symbol=note_with_outline>",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23106,
"en": "I'm not liking what I'm seeing...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23107,
"en": "Hey, it's me.\nI sent the girl your way.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23108,
"en": "She should be there any minute...\nYou've got everything ready, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 23109,
"en": "Nah, she hasn't caught on at all.\nI don't think she suspects a thing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a16|#",
"max": null
},
{
